WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:04,970
Searched and searched, searched and searched

2
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:06,130
Nian Nian is gone

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,570
This matter ends here

4
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:09,090
starting from today

5
00:00:09,090 --> 00:00:17,830
Our Shen family only has one daughter, Pearl, Xiao Mo

6
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,660
You miss me deeply

7
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:20,660
I'm very relieved

8
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,840
But the person who happened has passed away

9
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,200
Just stop making trouble

10
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:26,660
Tomorrow is our wedding

11
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:29,270
Although Nian Nian is gone

12
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:30,830
But the legato cannot be destroyed

13
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:37,190
It’s ridiculous that Pearl will marry you instead of Nian Nian

14
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,140
Who will I marry at the end of my life?

15
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,740
It's your turn to make the decision

16
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:57,160
Don't even dare to come in to kill fish

17
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:59,520
Then I'll use them to kill them.
